## Google Antigravity

This project uses Google Antigravity. Keep client-neutral agreements in `AGENTS.md`; use `.agents/rules/` for triggered constraints and `.agents/skills/` for focused multi-step procedures.

Use only project-scoped MCP servers declared in `.agents/mcp_config.json`. Keep credentials and OAuth state outside version control. Record installation, discovery, authentication, execution evidence, and limitations in `docs/setup.md`.

Use the project skills relevant to the current task. Do not treat an installed skill as proof that its external service, account, or workflow is available.
